<title>USA: Valspar, Renner Herrmann complete Brazil venture.</title>
<headline>Valspar, Renner Herrmann complete Brazil venture.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp said Wednesday it and Renner Herrmann SA completed the formation of a Brazilian joint venture to manufacture and sell packaging coatings in South America.</p>
<p>Each company owns 50 percent of the venture. Valspar said sales are expected to exceed $10 million in the first year of operation.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
